# Personal Profile
# Copy this file to personal_profile.md and fill in your own details.
# personal_profile.md is gitignored — it will never be committed.
#
# The agent calls context_load("personal_profile.md") when it needs background
# about you. Keep it factual and concise — bullet points work best.

## General
- Age: XX
- Location: [city, country]
- Languages: [list]

## Physical
- Height / Weight: XXXcm / XXkg
- Fitness level: [beginner / intermediate / active]
- Main sports: [e.g. running, climbing, cycling]

## Work
- Current role: [title at company/sector]
- Background: [brief career summary, e.g. "3 yrs engineering → 5 yrs data science → PM"]

## Habits & context
- Diet: [any restrictions or preferences]
- Schedule: [e.g. "works remotely", "early riser", "travels frequently"]
- Partner / family: [optional — only add if relevant to lifestyle agent]

## Anything else the agent should know
- [Add any context that helps agents give better, more personalised answers]
